    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-12-11 00:10:00 EST Expires: 2025-12-11 06:15:00 EST Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Target Area: Fleming; Montgomery; Bath; Rowan; Estill; Powell; Menifee; Rockcastle; Jackson; Pulaski; Laurel; Wayne; McCreary; Whitley; Elliott; Morgan; Johnson; Wolfe; Magoffin; Lee; Breathitt; Owsley; Martin A passing weather system will bring snow showers to eastern Kentucky overnight. While these will be scattered in nature, each one could lay down a quick half inch of accumulation and have wind gusts to 30 mph. Use caution when traveling through the night. Be prepared for some slick spots on untreated roads and especially bridges, overpasses, and ridgetopd.",
